{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_81F381C1","title":"Thank You","entry":"Dlg_81F381C1::entry","exit":"Dlg_81F381C1::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B040693C","articyId":"72057697117170291","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"My future first mate! What fortunes have you come to bring me now?","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My future first mate! What fortunes have you come to bring me now?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":150.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46619","byteOffset":31969496,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_28278213","articyId":"72057697117170312","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"First mate! A ship needs a few things: sails, a rudder, and a captain. And a captain, one worth his salt, needs a dependable first mate.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"First mate! A ship needs a few things: sails, a rudder, and a captain. And a captain, one worth his salt, needs a dependable first mate.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23610","byteOffset":16810136,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_61182570","articyId":"72057697117170326","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"What a glorious piece of writing that was! I'm having streamers reach out to me. Streamers! Before this, the only kinda streamers I knew of were ones we threw overboard after looting a booze cruise.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What a glorious piece of writing that was! I'm having streamers reach out to me. Streamers! Before this, the only kinda streamers I knew of were ones we threw overboard after looting a booze cruise.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19609","byteOffset":15301184,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_DACE1DCE","articyId":"72057697117170340","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Aye! Now, what do you say? Leave the land for a life at sea? Join me crew?","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye! Now, what do you say? Leave the land for a life at sea? Join me crew?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46103","byteOffset":31772448,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_893DB284","articyId":"72057697117170362","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Ahhhh! Life on the Gridless Sea. One devoid of material gains... besides TREASURE! The reward for back-breaking-skin-callousing-hard work.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ahhhh! Life on the Gridless Sea. One devoid of material gains... besides TREASURE! The reward for back-breaking-skin-callousing-hard work.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32925","byteOffset":20341064,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_C22162AC","articyId":"72057697117170397","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Oh, well, that's a doldrum conundrum I'd say. The sea ain't for everyone, that's sure as the tides.","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, well, that's a doldrum conundrum I'd say. The sea ain't for everyone, that's sure as the tides.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35718","byteOffset":27861416,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_7AF070C7","articyId":"72057697117170413","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Taylor Hernz","text":"Well, I shall leave you with this because I'm an admirable Captain who sticks to his word. Until next time ye landlubber!","speakerId":"Ntt_9C42C4AC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I shall leave you with this because I'm an admirable Captain who sticks to his word. Until next time ye landlubber!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30862","byteOffset":19556928,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_311296A1","articyId":"72057697117170296","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Future WHAT?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Future WHAT?","TextSheVersion":"Future WHAT?","TextTheyVersion":"Future WHAT?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":450.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17614","byteOffset":14553176,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_55CA2D6C","articyId":"72057697117170304","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I saw the article!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I saw the article!","TextSheVersion":"I saw the article!","TextTheyVersion":"I saw the article!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":450.